THE DATA IS NOT COVERED BY THE ABOVE.

The satellite patches distributed with this repository are the EuroSAT
dataset, by Patrick Helber, Benjamin Bischke, Andreas Dengel and Damian Borth,
which is itself MIT licensed and is redistributed here under that licence.

  Helber, P., Bischke, B., Dengel, A. and Borth, D. (2019). EuroSAT: A Novel
  Dataset and Deep Learning Benchmark for Land Use and Land Cover
  Classification. IEEE Journal of Selected Topics in Applied Earth
  Observations and Remote Sensing.

  https://github.com/phelber/EuroSAT
  Zenodo DOI 10.5281/zenodo.7711810

The patches are the original data, repackaged into array files and split into
a training and a test set. The band order was corrected to canonical
Sentinel-2 order. The pixel values are unchanged.
